    {
      "id": "guide-v3-19",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1172,
      "y": 85,
      "width": 458.64000000000004,
      "height": 151.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263238",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "guide-card-17"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3287,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2489,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794657883993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "概览显示全曲；框选范围对应下方的放大时间窗口。\n平移或缩放时，所有可见轨道保持同一刻度。\n“定位所选”聚焦事件；“适应全曲”恢复全景。\n\n工程：TimelineViewState（新增）。\nstartSec / endSec / pixelsPerSec 描述统一视窗。",
      "originalText": "概览显示全曲；框选范围对应下方的放大时间窗口。\n平移或缩放时，所有可见轨道保持同一刻度。\n“定位所选”聚焦事件；“适应全曲”恢复全景。\n\n工程：TimelineViewState（新增）。\nstartSec / endSec / pixelsPerSec 描述统一视窗。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
