      "text": "Workbench：所有标注共用一套编辑器",
      "originalText": "Workbench：所有标注共用一套编辑器",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-v3-35",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3682,
      "y": 85,
      "width": 475.9199999999999,
      "height": 176.39999999999998,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263238",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "guide-card-33"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6055,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4585,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794657883993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所有标注统一为 id、startSec、可选 endSec 和 text。\n画面想法、修改意见与 Agent 回复统一放入 comments。\n每条批注只有 role 和 text，按数组顺序排列。\n有 endSec 是区间，省略 endSec 就是瞬时点。\n\n工程：TimelineEvent / Comment（新增）。\n不为歌词、分镜或不同作者建立另一套编辑器。",
      "originalText": "所有标注统一为 id、startSec、可选 endSec 和 text。\n画面想法、修改意见与 Agent 回复统一放入 comments。\n每条批注只有 role 和 text，按数组顺序排列。\n有 endSec 是区间，省略 endSec 就是瞬时点。\n\n工程：TimelineEvent / Comment（新增）。\n不为歌词、分镜或不同作者建立另一套编辑器。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
