      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "时间编辑：点与区间的共用能力",
      "originalText": "时间编辑：点与区间的共用能力",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-v3-39",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3682,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 466.55999999999995,
      "height": 176.39999999999998,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263238",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "guide-card-37"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6747,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5109,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794657883993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "区间编辑起止、整体平移或切分；点事件只编辑单时间。\n吸附只影响本次操作，拖拽与数值输入更新同一对象。\n区间采用 [startSec, endSec)，时间为音频秒数。\n写入时检查时间为有限数值、起止有序且不越界。\n\n工程：TimelineEvent / WorkbenchCommand（新增）。\n不同时保存秒数、帧号、采样位置等多套时间副本。",
      "originalText": "区间编辑起止、整体平移或切分；点事件只编辑单时间。\n吸附只影响本次操作，拖拽与数值输入更新同一对象。\n区间采用 [startSec, endSec)，时间为音频秒数。\n写入时检查时间为有限数值、起止有序且不越界。\n\n工程：TimelineEvent / WorkbenchCommand（新增）。\n不同时保存秒数、帧号、采样位置等多套时间副本。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
