      "locked": false,
      "text": "边界关系：联动与设为紧邻",
      "originalText": "边界关系：联动与设为紧邻",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "guide-v3-43",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3682,
      "y": 755,
      "width": 528.48,
      "height": 201.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263238",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "guide-card-41"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 7439,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5633,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794657883993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "联动公共边界：A.end = B.start，拖动时两端一起改。\n设为紧邻：用户主动选择连接点，消除原本的间隙。\n默认独立，不按短间隙猜测关系，保留真实人声留白。\n重叠轨须明确选择一对邻居，不能自动猜测。\n\n工程：BoundaryLink / WorkbenchCommand（编辑会话状态）。\nJSON 只保存操作后的起止时间，不存 boundary_links。\n重载后不自动恢复会话中的边界绑定。",
      "originalText": "联动公共边界：A.end = B.start，拖动时两端一起改。\n设为紧邻：用户主动选择连接点，消除原本的间隙。\n默认独立，不按短间隙猜测关系，保留真实人声留白。\n重叠轨须明确选择一对邻居，不能自动猜测。\n\n工程：BoundaryLink / WorkbenchCommand（编辑会话状态）。\nJSON 只保存操作后的起止时间，不存 boundary_links。\n重载后不自动恢复会话中的边界绑定。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
    },
