    {
      "id": "guide-v3-59",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1172,
      "y": 1475,
      "width": 478.0799999999999,
      "height": 201.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263238",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "guide-card-57"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 10207,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794657883993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "页面 #f3f5f5，编辑面板 #ffffff。\n主波形底 #b8cdd2，波形线 #355f69。\n选中底 #e7f2f2，强调与选中描边 #166b75。\n正文 #263238，辅助字 #637079，边框 #cbd2d6。\n\n文本保持完全不透明，不对整块容器降低 opacity。\n选区可用强调色约 10% 的局部覆盖，文字独立。\n事件颜色：event.color → track.color → 默认青绿。",
      "originalText": "页面 #f3f5f5，编辑面板 #ffffff。\n主波形底 #b8cdd2，波形线 #355f69。\n选中底 #e7f2f2，强调与选中描边 #166b75。\n正文 #263238，辅助字 #637079，边框 #cbd2d6。\n\n文本保持完全不透明，不对整块容器降低 opacity。\n选区可用强调色约 10% 的局部覆盖，文字独立。\n事件颜色：event.color → track.color → 默认青绿。",
