    {
      "id": "guide-v3-75",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3682,
      "y": 1515,
      "width": 564.48,
      "height": 251.99999999999997,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#263238",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "guide-card-73"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12975,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 9825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794657883993,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Project { version, name, audio?, nodes, comments? }\nGroup { kind, id, name, children, comments? }\nTimeline { kind, id, name, items, color?, comments? }\nEvent { id, startSec, endSec?, text, color?, comments? }\nComment { role: human | agent, text }\n\nchildren 保留多层级，items 保留同轨事件，数组保留顺序。\n不要求 hash、revision、分析清单或任务状态字段。\n自定义 color 可选保存；锁、播放偏好不进入业务 JSON。\n参考：docs/annotator/example.json（合成示例）。",
      "originalText": "Project { version, name, audio?, nodes, comments? }\nGroup { kind, id, name, children, comments? }\nTimeline { kind, id, name, items, color?, comments? }\nEvent { id, startSec, endSec?, text, color?, comments? }\nComment { role: human | agent, text }\n\nchildren 保留多层级，items 保留同轨事件，数组保留顺序。\n不要求 hash、revision、分析清单或任务状态字段。\n自定义 color 可选保存；锁、播放偏好不进入业务 JSON。\n参考：docs/annotator/example.json（合成示例）。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true
